{"title":"广东省委常委会召开会议 统筹推进疫情防控和经济社会发展","date":"2020-05-07","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\r\nmso-outline-level:2\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#2E2E2E;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">广东省委常委会召开会议<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<h3 align=\"center\" style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;line-height:173%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nHelvetica\">统筹推进疫情防控和经济社会发展</span></h3>\r\n<h3 align=\"center\" style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;line-height:173%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nHelvetica\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></h3>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"color: rgb(27, 27, 27); font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 19px; text-align: justify;\">​</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 21px; color: #1b1b1b;\">5月6日，广东省委常委会暨省新冠肺炎防控领导小组（指挥部）召开会议，深入学习贯彻习近平总书记关于统筹推进疫情防控和经济社会发展工作重要讲话和重要指示批示精神，听取我省&ldquo;五一&rdquo;期间新冠肺炎疫情防控工作有关情况的汇报，研究部署下一步工作。省委书记李希主持会议。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:宋体;color:#1b1b1b\">会议强调，要深入学习贯彻习近平总书记重要讲话和重要指示批示精神，深刻认识到疫情防控和复工复产复学任务仍然艰巨，始终坚持不松懈、不松劲，慎终如始、善作善成，以&ldquo;双统筹&rdquo;的工作成效为全国大局作出广东努力、广东担当。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-color=\"rgb(89, 195, 249)\" data-style-id=\"26630\" data-support=\"96编辑器\">\r\n\t<section style=\"margin:10px 5px;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"box-shadow: rgb(89, 195, 249) 0px 0px 8px 0px inset; padding: 20px 10px 10px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"30%\" style=\"background-color: #59c3f9; height: 2px; width: 30%; color: #ffffff;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color: rgb(89, 195, 249); display: inline-block; padding: 2px 15px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t一</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"30%\" style=\"background-color: #59c3f9; height: 2px; width: 30%; color: #ffffff;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin:10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 2px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(27, 27, 27);\">要认真抓好常态化防控措施落实，继续织密织牢联防联控、群防群控网络，因时因势制定发布清晰工作指引，加强宣传报道和舆论引导，坚持精准施策、分类指导，以更严要求、更实作风把各项防控措施抓实抓细抓落地。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-color=\"rgb(89, 195, 249)\" data-style-id=\"26630\" data-support=\"96编辑器\">\r\n\t<section style=\"margin:10px 5px;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"box-shadow: rgb(89, 195, 249) 0px 0px 8px 0px inset; padding: 20px 10px 10px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"30%\" style=\"background-color: #59c3f9; height: 2px; width: 30%; color: #ffffff;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color: rgb(89, 195, 249); display: inline-block; padding: 2px 15px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t二</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"30%\" style=\"background-color: #59c3f9; height: 2px; width: 30%; color: #ffffff;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin:10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 2px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 宋体; color: #1b1b1b;\">要继续做好外国来粤人员疫情防控工作，抓好&ldquo;十二个强化&rdquo;措施落实，从各个环节精准做好外国来粤人员服务管理，注重形成长效机制，不断巩固工作成效。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-color=\"rgb(89, 195, 249)\" data-style-id=\"26630\" data-support=\"96编辑器\">\r\n\t<section style=\"margin:10px 5px;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"box-shadow: rgb(89, 195, 249) 0px 0px 8px 0px inset; padding: 20px 10px 10px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"30%\" style=\"background-color: #59c3f9; height: 2px; width: 30%; color: #ffffff;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color: rgb(89, 195, 249); display: inline-block; padding: 2px 15px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t三</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"30%\" style=\"background-color: #59c3f9; height: 2px; width: 30%; color: #ffffff;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin:10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 2px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 宋体; color: #1b1b1b;\">要毫不放松做好医院和隔离点安全防护，进一步加强督促检查，及时查找和堵塞漏洞，加强在岗人员的日常管理和服务保障，确保医院和隔离点防控到位、安全可靠。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-color=\"rgb(89, 195, 249)\" data-style-id=\"26630\" data-support=\"96编辑器\">\r\n\t<section style=\"margin:10px 5px;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"box-shadow: rgb(89, 195, 249) 0px 0px 8px 0px inset; padding: 20px 10px 10px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"30%\" style=\"background-color: #59c3f9; height: 2px; width: 30%; color: #ffffff;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color: rgb(89, 195, 249); display: inline-block; padding: 2px 15px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t四</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"30%\" style=\"background-color: #59c3f9; height: 2px; width: 30%; color: #ffffff;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin:10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 2px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #59c3f9;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:宋体;color:#1b1b1b\">要以更大力度推动复工复产。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:宋体;color:#1b1b1b\">持续关注解决企业实际困难，<strong>及时优化政策环境</strong>。更好促进产业链协同复工复产，推动复工复产提速扩面。<strong>结合庆祝经济特区建立40周年，多谋划推进&ldquo;双区&rdquo;建设、&ldquo;双城&rdquo;联动的大项目好项目，坚持传统基建与新基建并重，补短板工程与塑优势工程并用，以更多发展红利对冲疫情影响。</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-color=\"rgb(89, 195, 249)\" data-style-id=\"26630\" data-support=\"96编辑器\">\r\n\t<section style=\"margin:10px 5px;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"box-shadow: rgb(89, 195, 249) 0px 0px 8px 0px inset; padding: 20px 10px 10px; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"30%\" style=\"background-color: #59c3f9; height: 2px; width: 30%; color: #ffffff;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color: rgb(89, 195, 249); display: inline-block; padding: 2px 15px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t五</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"30%\" style=\"background-color: #59c3f9; height: 2px; width: 30%; color: #ffffff;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin:10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 2px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #59c3f9;\"><span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:华文中宋;color:#1b1b1b\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 宋体;\">要有序抓好复学工作。用心用情用功把学生健康管理和教学安排、文体活动、用餐保障、心理辅导、校园治安等方方面面做细做实做周全，及时堵塞漏洞，确保师生安全。</span></span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\">\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>"}